> patrimoine-et-compagnie@0.0.0 test:publication-expansion
> node scripts/test-publication-models.mjs

8 model allocations, 10 selections / 21 assets: source scopes, exact weights, incomplete cases, shared exports and periods verified.
Record loader: offline/403/429/500, empty/malformed/wrong/older payloads, deadline, retry, concurrent requests and successful cache verified.
